{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_title", "source_sha256": "ac5ed61517f8211ff0eac4c1e6e98077911c2faec63984aa785d719f346bddea", "ja": "聞かせて、キミの気持ち", "zh": "我想知道你的心意", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5188cf9a8060ad20f0b50822e19c6f3121681a4e503977692f4d24011d9e75a4", "ja": "プロデューサーからセクシーな身体ではなく\r\n歌で観客をトリコに、と言われた莉緒。セク\r\nシーを認めてもらえないと嘆くが、このみ、\r\n歌織と語り合う中で、ファンの1人1人へ\r\nきちんと思いを届ける事が大切と気が付く。", "zh": "莉绪被制作人要求不能用性感身躯，而是用\n歌声来虏获观众的心。这让莉绪感到自己的\n性感不受认同，因此怨叹不已。\n但在跟木实与歌织谈话的过程当中，她发现\n最重要的还是将心意好好传达给每一位粉丝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1000_046rio", "source_sha256": "36dbe8a136cd5ea00ccc3546e2f52104ebaee2d5f86f222a2968386eeea76d91", "ja": "ありがと～～～！\nみんな、大好き～～～！　愛してるわ～～～っ！", "zh": "谢谢～～～！\n最喜欢大家了～～～！我爱你们～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1001_null", "source_sha256": "ea22dc9ccf96159c4955e80eb7da05311313437cc97cd6267b7ca77b79dde72f", "ja": "わああああ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "82ddf1211bcbdb103cc0aef66ead40a7624e6311eeded929c2433c7c108048be", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ、はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……。\n{$P$}くん、お疲れさま！", "zh": "呼、呼、呼、呼、呼……\n{$P$}，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1003_p", "source_sha256": "648e48b6696b7f6b6e2d642f82313c6c0708e73702e28bbd67d05919dba79509", "ja": "莉緒、お疲れ！　最初から最後まで、ずっと\n目が離せなかったよ。いいステージだったな！", "zh": "莉绪，辛苦你了！\n我从头到尾都移不开目光，这场表演很棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "98db95fe492d1553e0c923168f101fe5e8243cea5ed147c414a1272d1b2dd150", "ja": "フフ、ありがと♪　でも、ファンのみんなのおかげね。\n私の歌で、すっごく喜んでくれて……。", "zh": "呵呵，谢啦♪不过，这也是多亏了各位粉丝们喔。\n大家听我唱歌时，看起来都好开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "4b7723d556d820aeea1ae94e8cf394a8a934ef571bc356f71e7250bf7991dfcb", "ja": "……ねえ、{$P$}くん、\n私の気持ち、みんなに……届いたかな？", "zh": "……欸，{$P$}，\n我的心意……有传达给大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1006_p", "source_sha256": "35835b948d4d7a61a45cb5c6424b05e9d66655e3f1f336c5fb80870c54bb31c1", "ja": "もちろん。しっかり届きすぎて、みんなすっかり\n莉緒のトリコになったかもしれないぞ！", "zh": "那当然，你传达出的心意简直多到满出来了。\n这下大家的心想必都被莉绪给彻底虏获啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "011bfa4230da6e5139f9f2333efec9379f273b8b532c8793b9ad90f8fbeba959", "ja": "ホント！？　やだ、どうしよう？　じゃあ、\nお礼に今度こそ、セクシーサービスしてくるわね！", "zh": "真的吗！？讨厌，该怎么办？\n为了回礼，待会就放送一点性感福利给大家吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1008_p", "source_sha256": "caf7f6c6318bf4c2be5b960222cd8726ab0b8a5746577d90c1317cb7da04b2c6", "ja": "い、いや、待ってくれ！\nそういうのは違うと思う！", "zh": "不、不行，先等等！\n我觉得这种回礼不太好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "a77e2e408e45aed87df87db7fcbde8819174e8c2936eafd2b374e9afd30302bf", "ja": "え～っ、どうして～！？", "zh": "咦～为什么～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "0d4311f5d83e227784171e17ed117eeb02d15674a4f298eb93d2b4733361a6ef", "ja": "私もそう思うわ、莉緒ちゃん。", "zh": "我也这么觉得喔，莉绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "e50e25b711f1716047d49d065ef2f423e31c96da1a475c00b4f8b92e3e4e0f76", "ja": "そうね。いくらアダルティな私でも、\n今はやめた方がいいと思うわ♪", "zh": "是啊，就算是充满成熟魅力的我，\n也觉得现在别这么做比较好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "f8ea090680b9e3d091e826bff97f45c757783a31f50b633e744fbc9feaca9ba2", "ja": "歌織ちゃんに、このみ姉さんまで……。\nやっぱりそうなの？", "zh": "连小歌和木实姊都这么说……\n果然还是不要比较好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c421a4f2a70435b2f15333636f2284486ed82501969b97d9a8cb6edd3b2a4983", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れさまでした。莉緒の歌もよかった\nですけど、サポートも素晴らしかったと思います！", "zh": "你们两位都辛苦了。\n莉绪的歌当然不用说，但你们的支援也很完美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "31daa4165ed75f18146d1265a8d6d6d44d30b14f1124be9b3fac8ad577e3ef15", "ja": "それは、センターの莉緒ちゃんの思いに引き込まれた\nからです、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "那是因为我们被莉绪这位Center的心意给打动了啊，\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "38ef4947bb3a25669420416ca4adbe5d8837f8f7b253be48d86e73d1f78c6d9e", "ja": "だって、今日のステージの莉緒ちゃん……\nとっても可愛かったものっ♪", "zh": "毕竟今天舞台上的莉绪……\n真的很可爱嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "4c168d23d8907b3108466ad84e840af762db1d3f1172e25ce82182ea63fb58fc", "ja": "えっ？　か、可愛いって、私が……？", "zh": "咦？可、可爱？我吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "3a398ed280e4bbc124cb7917dd2bf01cc0932651b53baae558804bd2502b3832", "ja": "そうね、想いをこめて歌う莉緒ちゃんの一生懸命な瞳\n……キラキラして、とっても可愛かったわ♪", "zh": "是啊，莉绪倾注着心意唱歌时那拚命的眼神……\n闪闪发光的，非常可爱喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "592b4d11f53e21c7eee634228188a2093fe549c25f133387c4994b0be47c6b46", "ja": "ね、{$P$}もそう思うでしょ？", "zh": "{$P$}也这么觉得吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1019_p", "source_sha256": "327587207b7936370ced1b95271280632f84cb3abcdc2873d23646f57257f6b0", "ja": "そうですね。今日の莉緒は、いつもとは少し違う……\nいや、いつも以上に可愛かったと思います。", "zh": "是啊，我觉得今天的莉绪，和平常有点不一样……\n不，是比平常还要可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "442735b2e1a8880008f4f2cc598842fbdd41e4c65c99cacb30c8afbe5a298e37", "ja": "{$P$}くんまで……。\nやだもう、やめてってば～！", "zh": "连{$P$}都……\n讨厌，不要这样啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "81f73df65b1b3e63110324ba71e57e643a1d9c0f0b8ee5d69815022bb0373bf8", "ja": "だいたい、可愛くなれてたとしても……\nそれって、ふたりのアドバイスのおかげだし。", "zh": "而且就算我真的变可爱……\n也是因为有你们两人的建议啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "eb76d56504a417fd96abf6871861e07612e09372e24186b2567aed785661a765", "ja": "あら、私だって。莉緒ちゃんのアドバイスのおかげで、\nセンター公演を無事に終えられたんだもの。", "zh": "哎呀，我那时也是因为有莉绪的建议，\n才能顺利完成Center公演啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "05db2ee7cef759e15f7d8bd48aab7efe2077372ffe03703965416b7451f62567", "ja": "私も莉緒ちゃんには、心配かけちゃったものね。\nフフッ、困ったときはお互い様ってことよね♪", "zh": "我也让莉绪替我操心过呢。\n呵呵，有困难的时候就应该互相帮助嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1024_p", "source_sha256": "5ea1e46fe938eb3faeb0a4ad17de9ad7c81da68bb3c7d9fa562532d4698888ce", "ja": "そう思います。みんなで高め合っていってこその、\n765プロ劇場ですからね！", "zh": "我也这么认为。大家互相切磋琢磨、彼此精进，\n才是765艺能剧场该有的样子啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1025_046rio", "source_sha256": "8c660d49e218e4ff64c30e26fd61c2eba1db613d2e66b3f3d988d1d78cd44ee5", "ja": "……フフッ、またそんなこと言って。\nま、いいわ。", "zh": "……呵呵，你老是喜欢说这种话。\n哎，算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "a26720e621e9a3ae066423dace9a1ea61deb2f3ae9d3f23b28352574bdf47528", "ja": "それじゃ、そろそろ打ち上げに……\n行きたいところだけど、まだ終わってないわよね！", "zh": "那么，虽然差不多想去开庆功宴了……\n但公演还没结束对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1027_p", "source_sha256": "2b7840e3645ae67764c13c5f7d35c7635912328990df49352125186af089567e", "ja": "ああ、アンコールの声がここまで響いてるからな。\n莉緒、準備はいいか？", "zh": "是啊，安可声连这里都听得见呢。\n莉绪，你准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1028_046rio", "source_sha256": "8478626198915333dfd3b81be794da71a6c085f6abcbb69571a1a4c2461a01ec", "ja": "もちろん♪　今日はとことん、\n私の歌を届けてくるわ！", "zh": "当然♪\n今天我要尽情献上我的歌声！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1029_046rio", "source_sha256": "be4f9ce3e657b7bd4031480f8a668421b032da093dfea911d593f0d5f8105544", "ja": "来てくれたみんなと……。\nあと、{$P$}くんにもね！", "zh": "献给来参加的各位……\n然后，也献给{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "702be15599380da48a62a32d7ebc25594a192403784afceb70fa3ab195c358f2", "ja": "みんな、お待たせ～！\n私たちの夜は、まだまだ終わらせないわよ～♪", "zh": "大家久等了～！\n我们的夜晚，还没那么早结束喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1031_null", "source_sha256": "b15edf6705ceb5c6c6bfef61ae75a3d5a3eba80c7c62d4e257363d4bfa8f0867", "ja": "わああああ～っ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1032_p", "source_sha256": "bea60e17de698be0d0316cf18831e26a15bbcec096672cc7171f2849749ae7f4", "ja": "（莉緒がこれから、どんなアイドルになっていくのか。\n先のことは、まだまだわからない）", "zh": "（莉绪今后会成长为什么样的偶像呢？\n未来的事，我还不清楚。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_023_1033_p", "source_sha256": "4ecc2d5a93f69722db03cc16253ab9b05ba007bb46002b54cf70105e7eab5f0e", "ja": "（それを見届けるためにも。これからもしっかり、\n莉緒を見つめ続けていかないとな！）", "zh": "（为了见证这点，\n今后我也要继续凝视着莉绪！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
